73
00:04:37.800 --> 00:04:39.509
Part three: grammar.

74
00:04:40.350 --> 00:04:43.801
Grammar focus: Gerund vs infinitive.

75
00:04:44.101 --> 00:04:45.311
Look at the pattern.

76
00:04:46.017 --> 00:04:48.005
I enjoy learning about cultures.

77
00:04:48.917 --> 00:04:51.265
I want to understand different perspectives.

78
00:04:52.150 --> 00:04:55.450
She avoids making assumptions and plans to travel next year.

79
00:04:56.400 --> 00:05:04.245
Some verbs take -ing (enjoy, avoid, keep, finish). Others take 'to' + verb (want, hope, plan, decide). Learn them in groups.

80
00:05:04.983 --> 00:05:08.878
Be careful! Don't say: I enjoy to learn about cultures.

81
00:05:10.833 --> 00:05:13.773
Say: I enjoy learning about cultures.

82
00:05:14.073 --> 00:05:15.968
After 'enjoy', use the -ing form.

83
