94
00:06:00.450 --> 00:06:02.066
I want blank understand them.

95
00:06:02.366 --> 00:06:05.219
A, to. B, -ing. C, for.

96
00:06:08.767 --> 00:06:10.348
The answer is A: to.

97
00:06:11.483 --> 00:06:14.493
Being able to change in new situations is blank.

98
00:06:14.793 --> 00:06:19.131
A, adaptability. B, humility. C, dialogue.

99
00:06:22.667 --> 00:06:25.491
